<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105563" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφ-ιώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>containing coagulated
				matter,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					7.120
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τροφιώδεος . . ὑποπέλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Coac.</u>
					567
				</span></i>
			; and so prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκ τροφιωδέων</span>
			should be restored for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ
			στροφωδέων</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.156
			</span></i> :—cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> ad loc. (<i><span class="en">
				16.819K.
			</span></i>): a different expl. is given by <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφιωδέων: σποδιωδῶν, τροφιὰ γὰρ
				ἡ σποδιὰ λέγεται;</span> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
</div>